key_functionalities.mermaid_diagram:
flowchart TD
    A([Enter Key Pressed]) --> B

    B{Row 1: Selection\ncode entered?}
    B -->|Yes| B1[Capture selection code\nand User ID from Row 1]
    B -->|No| C{Row 2: Selection\ncode entered?}
    C -->|Yes| C1[Capture selection code\nand User ID from Row 2]
    C -->|No| D{Row 3: Selection\ncode entered?}
    D -->|Yes| D1[Capture selection code\nand User ID from Row 3]
    D -->|No| E{Row 4: Selection\ncode entered?}
    E -->|Yes| E1[Capture selection code\nand User ID from Row 4]
    E -->|No| F{Row 5: Selection\ncode entered?}
    F -->|Yes| F1[Capture selection code\nand User ID from Row 5]
    F -->|No| G{Row 6: Selection\ncode entered?}
    G -->|Yes| G1[Capture selection code\nand User ID from Row 6]
    G -->|No| H{Row 7: Selection\ncode entered?}
    H -->|Yes| H1[Capture selection code\nand User ID from Row 7]
    H -->|No| I{Row 8: Selection\ncode entered?}
    I -->|Yes| I1[Capture selection code\nand User ID from Row 8]
    I -->|No| J{Row 9: Selection\ncode entered?}
    J -->|Yes| J1[Capture selection code\nand User ID from Row 9]
    J -->|No| K{Row 10: Selection\ncode entered?}
    K -->|Yes| K1[Capture selection code\nand User ID from Row 10]
    K -->|No| L[Clear selection code\nand User ID - No selection made]

    B1 & C1 & D1 & E1 & F1 & G1 & H1 & I1 & J1 & K1 --> M

    M{Valid selection\ncode and User ID\ncaptured?}
    M -->|Yes| N{What is the\nselection code?}
    M -->|No| O[Proceed to\nSearch/Page Forward]
    L --> O

    N -->|U or u| P[9: Navigate to\nUpdate User - COUSR02C]
    N -->|D or d| Q[10: Navigate to\nDelete User - COUSR03C]
    N -->|Other| R[11: Display\n'Invalid selection.\nValid values are U and D']
    R --> O
    O --> S([End of Selection Detection])
